# A buffer survives a small acid pulse
# Expectation: A half-neutralised acetate buffer should change pH far less than plain water after the same 0.0001 mol HCl pulse.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 CH3COOH 0.01mol
add v1 NaOH 0.005mol
measure v1 ph
new
add v2 water 100mL
measure v2 ph
add v1 HCl 0.0001mol
add v2 HCl 0.0001mol
measure v1 ph
measure v2 ph
